---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import MainCard from "@/components/MainCard.astro";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="语义花园"
  description="把寒柳别苑留下的文章、项目和学习记录投影到一张可探索的语义地图。"
>
  <MainCard
    title="语义花园"
    description="这是一个独立的内容语义地图工具，也是寒柳别苑的第一块真实花圃。"
    textOverlay="GARDEN"
    headerImageDark="/portfolio/semantic-garden-dark.png"
    headerImageLight="/portfolio/semantic-garden-light.png"
    infoIcon="lucide:map"
  >
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <section class="py-5 text-center" aria-labelledby="garden-intro">
        <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-primary">
          A map of what I leave behind
        </p>
        <h2 id="garden-intro" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl break-words text-2xl font-black leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
          文章不只是列表，也可以长成一座花园
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl break-words text-base leading-7 text-base-content/65 sm:text-lg">
          语义花园把文章、项目和学习记录放在同一张地图里。相近的内容会彼此靠近，主题相似的内容会形成一片小小的区域；点击节点，就能回到它原来的页面。
        </p>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-7 flex max-w-xs flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-3 sm:max-w-none sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center">
          <a href="https://latent-garden.zylatent.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary gap-2">
            打开完整花园
            <Icon name="lucide:external-link" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/latent-garden个人语义花园/" class="btn btn-outline gap-2">
            先读项目记录
            <Icon name="lucide:book-open" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="garden-map-title">
        <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-base-content/40">Live map</p>
            <h2 id="garden-map-title" class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold">在这里走走</h2>
          </div>
          <a href="https://latent-garden.zylatent.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link link-primary text-sm">
            在新窗口打开
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 shadow-sm">
          <iframe
            src="https://latent-garden.zylatent.com/?embed=1"
            title="Latent Garden 语义地图"
            loading="lazy"
            class="h-[620px] w-full border-0 sm:h-[720px]"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs leading-5 text-base-content/45">
          地图来自独立项目 Latent Garden；如果浏览器阻止嵌入，请使用上方的新窗口链接打开。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/25 bg-primary/5 px-6 py-8" aria-labelledby="garden-note">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Open project</p>
            <h2 id="garden-note" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">它不只服务于这一个博客</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/65">
              Latent Garden 与 Astro 博客保持松耦合：内容可以来自 Markdown、MDX、JSON、RSS 或公开网站，最后生成一份可部署的静态地图。寒柳别苑只是它目前最完整的一块试验田。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/ZhouYinLong-lab/Latent-Garden" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline shrink-0 gap-2">
            <Icon name="lucide:github" class="h-4 w-4" />
            查看源码
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </MainCard>
</BaseLayout>
